Column name: HTSeq__FPKM Type: FLOAT Description: FPKM is implemented at the GDC on gene-level read counts that are produced by HTSeq1 and generated using custom. scripts https://docs.gdc.cancer.gov/Encyclopedia/pages/HTSeq-FPKM/
